WEBVTT

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:23.880
<i>Every day I keep wondering if</i>
<i>there's something missing.</i>

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:31.230
<i>I still want to keep feeling my</i>
<i>heart beating in anticipation.</i>

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:38.960
<i>Ideals are far out of reach, but</i>
<i>reality is within my grasp.</i>

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>It's not easy standing against the wind,</i>
<i>but as long as I keep smiling...</i>

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:49.880
<i>... staying true to myself,</i>
<i>I'll become stronger.</i>

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:57.580
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll find him and take my chance.</i>

00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:04.560
<i>I'll make the whole world stop</i>
<i>to see the angel that I'll be.</i>

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:12.490
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll meet the man of my dreams.</i>

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:20.160
<i>Nothing can slow me down. Tomorrow</i>
<i>is just around the corner.</i>

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:48.170
"Sound Mind"

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.860
Point!

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.920
Unreal!

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:18.520
Good. Next!

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:23.600
FILE. 46
TOUKA1R1N'S
CHALLENGE

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:29.310
Oh, I'm exhausted.

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:32.300
Get a grip, you're on duty.

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:40.180
Hey! You shouldn't be jumping
out into traffic like that!

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:45.020
Kids don't know the first thing
about traffic safety.

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:46.960
Who are those kids?

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:49.660
Who are those kids?
Who, them? They're from the kendo class.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.200
They sure do have
energy to burn.

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:59.200
"Basic Nepalese"

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:05.180
I'm never going to Bokuto
Station again.

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:07.710
It's stupid! I'm not going anymore!

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:12.010
We should've helped clean before we left.

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:17.150
No problem. 'Cause I'm quitting kendo
class. It's not my problem anymore.

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:18.430
No way! Are you serious?

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:20.690
It's boring! I quit!

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.930
I don't need this stupid thing anymore!

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:26.900
Oh!

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:44.080
Hey, wait!

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:46.190
That's mine.

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:47.520
That's mine.
You said you didn't need it.

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:47.650
You said you didn't need it.

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:50.260
But I didn't mean I wanted to give it away.

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:55.290
Claim it at Bokuto Station, tomorrow at 4.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:59.300
Hey, hang on
a minute.

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:08.070
Those kids are
a real handful.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:10.310
Don't get involved in this, Natsumi.

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.280
But they're so insolent!

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:14.210
Just worry about your own work.

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:15.180
Yes.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:18.810
Sure is a
hot one.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:20.820
Have some tea.

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.790
Thanks.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:25.360
A Saburoku? Looks
like a child's.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.330
You like kendo, don't you Nakajima?

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.200
You like kendo, don't you Nakajima?
Haven't done it in a long time, though.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.630
This one has been
well-maintained.

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.320
How can you tell?

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.370
You put wax on it to keep the wood
from fraying. It's done very well.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:43.880
See here.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:47.880
"Golden Chance"

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:03.030
I'm here, so give me my shinai.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.800
I'm here, so give me my shinai.
Okay. But first, you have to do something.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.770
Huh?
Okay. But first, you have to do something.

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:14.980
One point. If you win, then it's over.

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:16.470
No way!

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:18.680
Yeah, not fair!

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:22.240
I'm going to use this instead.

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:25.750
Then it'll
be fair.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.940
Don't make
fun of me.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:30.610
Start!

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:07.620
Hideki!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:22.470
Just because things don't go your
way, is no reason to go and quit.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.710
What don't you like about it?

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.850
When I lose.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:30.220
Why would you quit, just because you lost?

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:32.320
'Cause it sucks.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:33.550
Huh?

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:35.610
Being weak sucks.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.020
So why don't you do something about it?

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:39.830
Huh?

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.790
Hold this.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:49.130
Don't move.

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:54.310
Wow!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:58.980
Hey...

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.500
My name's Shouji Toukairin.

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:04.010
Are you good,
Mr. Toukairin?

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:08.150
Good enough to
cut a banana.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:13.620
Teach me kendo,
okay?!

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:25.730
It's boiling. I'm going
to shrivel up!

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:26.870
Hey.

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.640
What's the matter?

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.610
I see something strange.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:32.370
What do you mean?

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:39.010
Fishing and
kendo?

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.550
I can't see the
connection.

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:43.320
Then you didn't have to come.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:45.930
But I want to be strong, too!

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:47.890
Me, too!

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:52.790
Hideki. Let's
go hit him.

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:53.770
What for?

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:56.240
Let's see how good he is.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.800
No way. You go.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:00.670
Okay.

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:01.410
Hey.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:03.040
Yes?!

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.210
Got a nibble.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.810
Hmm?

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:14.880
Ah, it got my
bait again!

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:17.720
Quit squirming
around.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.260
I'm gonna catch that stupid fish!

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:23.860
So am I!

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:26.490
Well? Isn't that
weird?!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.600
He's teaching them kendo, right?

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:30.540
What could it mean?

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:34.070
How about we think about
the traffic safety classes?

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:37.080
Still no plan and we're running out of time.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.510
Okay.

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:41.680
Natsumi!

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:44.510
Yeah, sure!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:51.190
Throw it!

00:08:51.560 --> 00:08:52.460
Hideki.

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:55.700
Hey! Where are you throwing it?!

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:58.530
You're going too fast!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:08.510
Hideki. What are you going to
do about our next practice?

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:12.340
Thanks very
much.

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:20.810
Mr. Toukairin. Are you sure
this will make me strong?

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:21.890
Why?

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:25.050
Why?
"Why?"

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:28.750
Hideki!

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.450
So it is
you!

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:33.030
You took off the other day, without
helping us clean up.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:37.730
I didn't say anything to the teacher, but
you shouldn't do that, you know.

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:39.240
I can if I
want to.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:41.070
"Traffic Safety Class"

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.210
There! Now there's just the preparations.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:46.370
The most difficult part.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:47.950
I know,
I know.

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:52.880
What are you talking about? Having good
manners is part of kendo too, you know!

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:56.750
Shut up! Quit being so stuck up!
Just because you beat me once!

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:58.690
Huh?

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:02.000
I wasn't being stuck up.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:05.760
I wasn't being stuck up.
You got lucky last time! You can't beat me!

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:09.760
Get off your high horse,
you stupid girl!

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:13.770
How can you say
that to me?!

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:16.610
Give me a break.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:18.770
Yeah, I will!

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.720
Howdy-doody, Toukairin.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:29.590
Hi.

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:32.220
What's the matter? Something happen?

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:35.060
Natsumi. We've got work to do.

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:35.820
Huh?

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:39.500
Come on! There's a lot to do at the station!

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.370
Ow! My best uniform!

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:44.740
So she's the one who beat you.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.710
Just one hit.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.340
Just one, right?

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:50.780
I still lost.

00:10:50.940 --> 00:10:52.550
You hate losing to girls that much, huh?

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:56.280
Who wouldn't? Girls shouldn't be strong.

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:57.680
Think so?

00:10:57.680 --> 00:10:59.680
I hate it.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:01.590
Look.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.920
What's this?

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:03.890
My girl.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.560
Huh?

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:09.550
Machapuchare. 6,993 m.

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:11.600
This?

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:15.860
Yeah, she's very formidable and beautiful.

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:17.940
She drives me out
of my mind.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:21.800
But that's why
I like her.

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:29.150
Let's go. The others will be waiting for us.

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:30.240
Mm-hmm.

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:39.250
"Rabbit and Turtle For Traffic Safety"

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:45.230
All kids think about is winning or
losing. Well, that's life.

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:49.320
Perhaps that boy actually
likes the girl.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.770
Eh? Then you don't think he was
mad because he lost at kendo?

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:56.100
Of course, I think it's a combination
of the two.

00:11:56.280 --> 00:12:02.310
He lost to a girl, he got upset, then he was
going to quit, and now he's trying hard.

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:03.680
Right, Yoriko?

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:05.880
That's exactly right,
Kennie!

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.820
Is that what boys are like?

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:10.310
Is that what boys are like?
Yes. I remember it well.

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:14.430
Right, Aoi! If any woman knows how
men think, it's you!

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:16.860
Please!

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:20.070
He's still going to practice, isn't he?

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:22.330
Yeah. They're in the cafeteria today.

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:25.510
I just can't follow his train of thought.

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:28.870
But how are the two going to make up?

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:35.480
I know! We'll force
them to make up!

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:38.420
There you go again with your wild ways.

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:41.790
It'll be fine! And everybody will be happy!

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:46.850
Hello! Delivery!

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:50.820
Sorry to scare
you like that.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:53.160
They're getting rid of
some flies for me.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.300
Flies?

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:03.000
Got it! Unreal!

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:05.850
You've got to smack it, nice and quick.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:08.110
Hi! I see you're at it!

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:10.170
Whoa! It's Bokuto's Xena-woman!

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.680
Who are you calling
Xena-woman?

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.090
Since you're good, I'll teach you something.

00:13:16.090 --> 00:13:18.560
What is it?

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:19.260
"Traffic Safety Class"

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:22.160
The Traffic Safety Class!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.200
What?! That's boring!

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:24.330
"Traffic Safety Class"

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:27.530
Is that
all?

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:32.430
What do you mean, "That's
boring?!" Is what "all?"

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:35.940
You don't have to teach us about traffic
safety! We know all that, already!

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:39.350
You are coming, like it or not!

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:41.280
Is that an order?

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:43.440
How perceptive, my boy.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:46.450
And you will invite the
entire kendo class.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:53.560
I'm pairing everyone
up like this.

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:57.260
That's an order. If you break your promise,
you know what will happen, don't you?

00:13:57.430 --> 00:13:59.170
What's that?

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:03.900
It's-a-se-cret!

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:09.540
I got Hideki to invite
Emi along.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:12.580
Miyuki said I went about it wrong, though.

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:15.210
No, that's not true.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:17.370
That's good!

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:19.780
And uh, actually...

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.080
Hmm?

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:25.850
Hey, look who's here. What,
did you forget something?

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:28.790
Um, uh...

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:36.160
I can't ask her, considering
what I said to her before.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:39.830
What're you talking about?
Forget it, it'll be fine.

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:42.780
Don't make things out to be so simple!

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.830
Don't make things out to be so simple!
What?!

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:46.480
The secrets of kendo.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:47.540
Huh?

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:54.350
Know yourself. Know your opponent.
And lunge without fear.

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:57.160
That's it?

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:02.060
Yes, but that's not easy.

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:17.970
Lunge without fear.

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:21.250
Hey, what were you about to say before?

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:24.550
Hey, what were you about to say before?
It was nothing, forget it.

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:24.680
It was nothing, forget it.

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:25.670
Weirdo.

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:28.840
"Traffic Safety Class"

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:41.190
Thank you. Thank
you very much.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:46.170
Hello! My name is Kennie!
And this is Yoriko.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:50.470
Kennie is just a baby, so he
doesn't know very much.

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:53.970
That's not true. I ask all
kinds of questions.

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:55.410
Well here's a question for you.
So you did come!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.310
Which is stronger, you or a car?
And so did you!

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:59.640
Almost everybody
I called is here.

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:01.350
They've got nothing else to do.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.480
They've got nothing else to do.
You made it, you kids!

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:11.260
Hideki!

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:16.000
Sorry I'm late.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.970
Sorry I'm late.
That's okay.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:27.300
Thanks for inviting me.

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:30.240
Has it started?

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:32.010
We'd better
hurry!

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:40.620
And then, the tortoise waited until the light
was green and safely crossed the road.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:45.790
The hare didn't wait for a green light, stalled
in the road, and couldn't go any further.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:50.340
And that concludes the story
of the tortoise and the hare.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:53.030
So when you see a red light,
wait at the crosswalk...

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:53.210
...until the light turns green.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:56.300
...until the light turns green.
This is what you call everyone being happy.

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:59.670
You have your own style of doing
things, that's for sure.

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:03.610
They made up and I deserve the credit.
Everyone did become happy, right?

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:04.980
Thank you.

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:09.110
Thank you.
You're very welcome.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:22.790
Stupid lousy
traffic jam!

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:24.440
We can't do a thing about it.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:27.800
We can't do a thing about it.
If we don't hurry, we'll miss kendo class!

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:29.710
How about turning on the patrol light?!

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:30.740
No can do.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:32.300
Didn't think so.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:35.540
The class goes until 4;30, so
we've got 30 minutes left.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.160
I get it.

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.520
<i>"Quit squirming</i>
<i>around."</i>

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:53.600
All right!

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:16.950
Now I understand!

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:24.230
Great!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:26.170
Look at them go!

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:27.930
We did it!

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:42.110
He's being beaten back. He's
losing his concentration.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.550
He'll lose, if this
keeps up.

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:54.320
It's all right to lose.
As long as...

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.390
As long as
what?

00:18:57.560 --> 00:19:00.530
As long as he can learn just
how enjoyable it is.

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:13.880
Go for it!

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.010
Go for it!
Have you forgotten the secrets?

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:17.850
I can't do this.

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:21.340
I can't do this.
You can do it, if you're in love!

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:25.120
With kendo,
I mean!

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:40.530
<i>Know myself.</i>

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:45.110
<i>Know my opponent.</i>

00:19:56.520 --> 00:20:00.620
<i>Lunge without fear.</i>

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:24.040
Point!

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:25.550
He did it!

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:30.650
He did it!
He won! He did it!

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:49.740
Our lessons are over now.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:51.730
Our lessons are over now.
How come?

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:53.400
I've taught you
the essentials.

00:20:53.510 --> 00:20:56.620
You've passed and have this to show for it.

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:59.110
But we've only started.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:03.050
You enjoy kendo. That's
what's essential.

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.260
Bye!

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:14.370
Bye!

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:17.000
Well that's
unusual.

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.470
I don't mean to
pester you.

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:22.940
But why did you offer to teach
them in the first place?

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:23.740
Because...

00:21:23.740 --> 00:21:25.540
Mm-hmm.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.880
It's a secret.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:29.180
What do you mean?!

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.580
Forget it.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:33.050
I can't! What are you hiding?

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:36.610
Uh, well... they just reminded me...

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:38.820
Yeah? Of what? Reminded you of what?

00:21:38.820 --> 00:21:40.190
Just drop it.

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:43.000
Come on, spit it out!

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:43.700
Forget it.

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:47.900
Forget nothing. How'll I sleep tonight?

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:48.430
Drop it.

00:21:48.430 --> 00:21:49.270
I won't!

00:21:49.270 --> 00:21:50.070
Forget it!

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:52.040
I'm not forgetting anything!

00:21:55.740 --> 00:22:01.950
<i>Every time I fall</i>
<i>out of love...</i>

00:22:02.010 --> 00:22:11.860
<i>... everything that I see</i>
<i>turns monochrome.</i>

00:22:12.460 --> 00:22:18.750
<i>We often used to go see the</i>
<i>games at the stadium...</i>

00:22:18.860 --> 00:22:28.610
<i>... but the good old days mean</i>
<i>nothing to me anymore.</i>

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:42.850
<i>Even after you've gone, I still wanna</i>
<i>tell the world what it is that I love.</i>

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:51.130
<i>Looking up to the sky, I try</i>
<i>holding back the tears.</i>

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:59.710
<i>Flags were moving in the wind and</i>
<i>things seemed brighter yesterday.</i>

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:07.780
<i>Looking up to the sky, we used</i>
<i>to talk about our dreams.</i>

00:23:07.850 --> 00:23:17.360
<i>No matter how far out of reach they seemed,</i>
<i>dreams could come true, or so it felt.</i>

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:24.800
<i>Tell me that that fire in your</i>
<i>eyes was not a lie.</i>

00:23:26.830 --> 00:23:28.130
"Tunnel Panic"

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:32.130
Spending all my time in
front of the desk...

00:23:32.240 --> 00:23:35.610
Things haven't changed as time passes
by, but things are bubbly.

00:23:35.780 --> 00:23:38.900
Chief, I'm afraid your condition
may not be good.

00:23:39.080 --> 00:23:41.640
Kobayakawa, you're the
partner of Tsujimoto...

00:23:41.810 --> 00:23:44.150
...but there are things you can,
and cannot do.

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:46.720
Next time on You're Under
Arrest, File 47...

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:48.320
...The Time Limit.

00:23:48.450 --> 00:23:50.460
It's so sudden.
